OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAUniting women in the isolation of
OL,4,Aultra marathons
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is not long since Anna Troup was
OL,7,Ftrotting along the Pennine Way, unable
OL,8,Fto hold her own head up without her
OL,9,Fhand due to exhaustion, bum-sliding
OL,10,Fdown summits on questionable terrain
OL,11,Fand generally suffering in the
OL,12,Fnotoriously gruelling Spine Race.
OL,14,FShe was the first woman to finish the
OL,15,Fnon-stop 268-mile (430km)
OL,16,Fultra-marathon on 15 January, where she
OL,17,Fran through parts of Cumbria,
OL,18,FNorthumberland National Park, Hadrian's
OL,19,FWall and the Cheviots.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
PN,39202
SC,0002
