OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F392A1795857935
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs1 wsj#57sj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAUniting women in the isolation of
OL,4,Aultra marathons
OL,5,
OL,6,FLooking over to the Northern fells as
OL,7,Fthe first snow of the season cloaks the
OL,8,Ftops, Troup recalls how "terrifyingly
OL,9,Falone" she was in parts of the race,
OL,10,Fparticularly up on Cross Fell, where
OL,11,Fshe faced blizzard, white-out
OL,12,Fconditions.
OL,14,FThat isolation is partly what has
OL,15,Fdriven Troup, who lives in Grasmere, to
OL,16,Fcreate a platform for women wanting to
OL,17,Fget into ultra marathons, providing
OL,18,Fskills and education.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
